---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ComingSoon from '../../components/ComingSoon.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Music" description="Chen-Ling Lin's clarinet story, performances, repertoire, and practice journal.">
  <header class="page-hero shell"><p class="eyebrow">Clarinet</p><h1>Music</h1><p class="lede">A record of the music I make with other people, and the instrument I hope never to put down.</p></header>
  <section class="section music-band"><div class="shell page-grid"><article class="prose" lang="zh-Hant"><h2>My Clarinet Story</h2><p>我從小學三年級開始吹單簧管，而這段關係的起點純屬意外。當時的我完全不了解單簧管，只是在眾多樂器之中選到了它。直到小學五年級準備報考音樂班，我才真正認真投入，也曾經想過，或許自己可以一直走在音樂這條路上。</p><p>後來因為現實考量，我沒有繼續把音樂當成唯一的升學方向，但也沒有真正離開它。當單簧管不再只和考試及升學目標綁在一起，我反而重新找回了單純的喜歡，也從練習、進步和完成曲目的過程中，再次感受到成就感。它漸漸成為生活裡紓解壓力的方式，也成為我願意一次次回去做的事情。</p><p>比起獨自練習，我更喜歡待在樂團裡。和其他人一起把不同聲部拼成完整的音樂，讓練習不再那麼枯燥；在排練與演出的過程中，我也認識了很好的朋友。未來，我希望自己能持續參與樂團，也希望無論生活如何改變，都不要真正放下單簧管。</p></article><aside><p class="eyebrow">Upcoming Performances</p><div class="performance-list"><div class="performance"><span class="small muted">27 Mar 2027</span><div>屹川管樂團<br /><span class="muted">Concert</span></div></div><div class="performance"><span class="small muted">Summer 2027</span><div>NCHU Wind Band<br /><span class="muted">Upcoming activities</span></div></div></div></aside></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell content-index"><section class="index-section"><h2>Repertoire</h2><ComingSoon compact /></section><section class="index-section"><h2>Practice Journal</h2><ComingSoon compact /></section><section class="index-section"><h2>Recordings & Photos</h2><ComingSoon compact /></section></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
